# Stable spec ID: iba-daiquiri. Source checked 2026-10-12. Machine generated; not human reviewed.

::ingredients
(rum; white Cuban) 60 ml
(lime: juice, fresh) 20 ml
(sugar, superfine) 2 bar spoons

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(cocktail glass)

::instructions
(sugar, superfine) + (rum; white Cuban) + (lime: juice, fresh) <stir, in (cocktail shaker)> ?= sugar dissolved
<add, ice> <shake> <strain, into a chilled (cocktail glass)>

